  "fault": {
    "name": "provider-outage",
    "title": "Payments fail: the provider hangs, and our circuit breaker fails fast",
    "cause": "the provider's charge and refund API hangs (5 s, then 503): our payments API's calls to it time out, each after 3 attempts, until its circuit breaker opens, after 5 calls in a row got no answer; from then on it fails fast, answering 503 'outcome unknown' at once without calling the provider, and lets one trial call through 10 s after it opened, and again after each trial that fails",
    "expected_symptoms": [
      "clients get 503 'outcome unknown', most of them at once: the 5xx share of POST /payments climbs",
      "the first calls still wait out their 3 timed-out attempts (about 10 s) until the breaker opens; after that only the trial calls wait, the first 10 s after it opened, then one 10 s after each that fails: the p95 latency may climb for about a minute, then drops",
      "provider calls end with no answer (timeouts) at first, klaxon.provider.attempts result no_answer; then the breaker refuses them, klaxon.provider.refused",
      "the payments API logs 'circuit breaker open', and its health check keeps passing: once the breaker opens, its worker threads are free again",
      "the money check passes: nothing was charged, so no money is wrong",
      "after it ends, the next trial call gets an answer and the breaker closes; payments and refunds whose outcome stayed unknown stay pending, with nothing charged or refunded: they need a decision (retry them with their keys, or mark them failed), and until then such a refund blocks new refunds on its payment"
    ],
    "expected_money": {
      "during": "passed",
      "after": "passed",
      "quiet": "passed"
    },
    "remedy": "nothing to change on our side: the provider must recover (escalate to it). Meanwhile the circuit breaker keeps the API answering at once, and closes again when a trial call gets an answer. After it recovers, the payments and refunds left pending need a decision (retry them with their keys, or mark them failed): a refund left pending blocks new refunds on its payment until it settles"
  },
